      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>
      Allow pods in <code>project-a</code> to reference images in <code>project-b</code> by entering the following command. In this example, the service account <code>default</code> in <code>project-a</code> is bound to the <code>system:image-puller</code> role in <code>project-b</code>:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc policy add-role-to-user \\\n    system:image-puller system:serviceaccount:project-a:default \\\n    --namespace=project-b"} lang="terminal" />
