      <h2 id="images-allow-pods-to-reference-images-from-secure-registries_using-image-pull-secrets" class="group scroll-mt-20">Allowing pods to reference images from other secured registries<a href="#images-allow-pods-to-reference-images-from-secure-registries_using-image-pull-secrets" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
