      <h3 id="using-pull-secret_using-image-pull-secrets" class="group scroll-mt-20">Using a pull secret in a workload<a href="#using-pull-secret_using-image-pull-secrets" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
